<title>PHILIPPINES: Alsons unaudited 1996 net 758 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Alsons unaudited 1996 net 758 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine holding firm Alsons Consolidated Resources Inc posted an unaudited net income of 758 million pesos in 1996 on revenues of 5.7 billion pesos, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>In 1995, the firm reported an audited net income of 127.354 million pesos on revenues of 709.223 million pesos, an exchange official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The official said Alson's disclosure statement was distributed to brokers before the start of trading on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
